@@ -6,6 +6,12 @@ Changelog
 Unreleased
 ++++++++++
 
+- Use the first ``@overload`` that accepts the arguments (according to the
+  typing rules) instead of combining the results of all overloads. Tuples,
+  lists, dicts and comprehensions are checked with the content they have at
+  runtime, also when they are unpacked with ``*`` or ``**``.
+- Support for ``Literal``
+
 0.20.1 (2026-10-12)
 +++++++++++++++++++
 
